ex.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 39 (page does not exist)\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 40 (page does not exist)\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U1\">U1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U2\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U2\">U2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U3\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U3\">U3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U4\">U4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U5\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U5\">U5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U6\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U6\">U6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U7\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U7\">U7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U8\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U8\">U8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U9 (page does not exist)\">U9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U10 (page does not exist)\">U10</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017212330\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 261/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2881/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 659/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7055/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.066      1 Template:ITest_box\n100.00%    8.066      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16982:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017212330 and revision id 99299. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}